Comprehensive Overview of the Figma Schema API

▪ The Figma Schema API is a REST-based interface enabling programmatic access to Figma’s design files, resources, and events.
▪ It supports authentication via OAuth2 and access tokens, with rate limits depending on subscription plans.
▪ The API exposes endpoints for files, images, users, comments, projects, components, styles, variables, and usage analytics.
