Authentication and Rate Limits

Access to the Figma Schema API requires authentication via OAuth2 or access tokens, ensuring secure and authorized usage. Users must sign up for a Figma account and obtain appropriate credentials to interact with the API.

Rate limits are enforced based on subscription plans:

• Users with Dev or Full seats on Professional, Organization, or Enterprise plans have per-minute rate limits ranging from 10 to 20 minutes, depending on the plan.
• These limits are designed to balance API availability and system load, ensuring fair use across users.

Developers should be aware of these limits when designing applications that interact with the API to avoid throttling and ensure smooth operation.

